**What was wrong:** Your Python 3.13 installation (at `/usr/local`) had its `pip` package code deleted — only the `pip-24.3.1.dist-info` metadata directory remained in `site-packages`. The `pip3` script still existed but couldn't import the missing `pip` module.

**What I did:**
