2. I extracted the correct pip 24.3.1 wheel that was bundled with Python 3.13's `ensurepip` (`/usr/local/lib/python3.13/ensurepip/_bundled/pip-24.3.1-py3-none-any.whl`) directly into the site-packages directory.
3. Verified pip works — `pip install --dry-run requests` successfully resolves and would install dependencies.

